        "html": "The most frequently asked question among people considering <strong>apartments in Thane</strong> is about the commute to Navi Mumbai, and this deserves a straightforward answer. Manpada does not provide a quick route to Navi Mumbai; in fact, there is no such option anywhere in Thane West. It only offers the best possible start to the journey. The Eastern Express Highway is just 200 metres away. It directly connects to the Thane-Belapur Road and the Airoli crossing, avoiding the delays that residents farther along Ghodbunder Road consider normal. When it comes to getting to an office in Airoli, Ghansoli, or Belapur, time is usually lost in those first two kilometres."
