        "html": "Since 2016 , Runwal Realty transitioned from Runwal Group, led by Mr. Sandeep Runwalwith its own leadership, identity and strategic direction. When you look up <strong>Runwal projects</strong> online, search specifically for Runwal Realty projects and check that the development is listed on runwalrealty.com before concluding, since listing websites often mix the two."
