        "html": "<strong>Regarding construction quality</strong>, the external indicators are the green certification and awards such as LEED Platinum for R City, IGBC Gold for R Square Andheri, IGBC Gold pre-certification for the Runwal One township in Thane, and recognition at the NSCI Safety Awards 2024 for occupational safety and health; this award reflects the standards at the site level rather than the photography of the finished product. These should be assessed by visiting a completed project since Runwal Elina, Runwal Elegante and Runwal Nirvana are all completed and now occupied. Walking their lobbies, basements and common areas, and asking residents how the developments have held up since handover, will tell you about finish quality and upkeep in ways not possible with a show flat."
